  202:     # reports a translated/foreign arch has not proven it is running a
  203:     # native binary, even though the loader canary and everything else
  204:     # above passed. The expected value is "arm64" (Go's GOARCH spelling,
  205:     # per supervisor/internal/server/server.go's defaultHelloArch() ƒ?" a
  206:     # deliberate M7 protocol choice, NOT uname -m's "aarch64" spelling).
  207:     # Found on real hardware (2026-08-19, physical Mac): this check
  208:     # originally required literal "aarch64" and failed every native-arm64
