  237: // nativePreflight runs every non-mutating readiness check plan section 10
  238: // item 3 requires before a native-arm64 attempt: Apple Silicon, Lima/VZ,
  239: // digests, translator, and resources. It never creates, starts, or mutates
  240: // a Lima machine or any host file.
  241: //
  242: // assetRoot is needed for the digests check ONLY when table came from
  243: // loadProfileTableOnly (the real production path: resolveProfileSelection
  244: // must decide the logical selection BEFORE it knows which concrete row to
  245: // hand loadMacOSProfile, so it necessarily only has the shallow,
  246: // pin-file-unaware row shape). Found on real hardware (2026-08-19,
